        "tree_id": "d19ffcc168049aed0192e75e9b6a9cea19dee379",
        "message": "Add Web Reader Phase 5 - Background Playback + Notification Controls\n\nFeatures:\n- WebReaderHandler (audio service for background playback)\n- System notification controls (play, pause, next, prev, stop)\n- Audio session management (interruption handling, headphone unplug)\n- Media item metadata (title, URL, album, artist) in notification\n- Background playback continues when app is minimized or screen off\n- Proper cleanup on pause/stop\n\nIntegration:\n- Page uses WebReaderHandler instead of direct TTS calls\n- AudioHandler manages full notification lifecycle\n- Chapter navigation callbacks for sleep timer\n- Sleep timer notified on chapter changes\n\nNew files:\n- web_reader_handler.dart (AudioHandler implementation for web reader)\n\nModified files:\n- web_reader_page.dart (use WebReaderHandler, metadata updates)\n- web_reader_provider.dart (chapter change callback for sleep timer)",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-08T17:01:08Z",
